   How it works: the :root block below repeats poggy_core's theme tokens
   (ui/hub/theme.css) with the Rosewood (black and gold) values. theme.js
   loads theme.css after this file and sets the owner's theme on <html>,
   so every var(--pg-...) here takes the server's theme. With the theme
   off (or the script on the owner's "keep their own colours" list), the
